# Local-only blocklist for publish.ps1
# Copy this file to .publish-blocklist (without .example) and edit before publishing.
# Lines starting with # are comments. One forbidden term per line.
# The publish.ps1 script reads this file and aborts the push if any term is found.

# Example terms (edit/remove as needed):
# my-internal-name
# private-project-codename
# old-organization-acronym
